# Environment variables for the chatbot feature
# Copy this file to .env.local if you need any of the overrides below.
#
# For normal local development you do NOT need this file at all. The chat API
# authenticates to the Vercel AI Gateway with VERCEL_OIDC_TOKEN, which the SDK
# fetches automatically once the project is linked (`vc link`) and you are
# logged in (`vc whoami`). See docs/chatbot-operations.md.

# Chat model (optional)
# Overrides DEFAULT_CHAT_MODEL in lib/chat-model.ts. Use this to swap models
# without a code change - most importantly when the AI Gateway retires a slug.
# Must be a slug the gateway currently serves; the integration test
# tests/integration/chat-model.test.ts prints the valid options when it fails.
# CHAT_MODEL=anthropic/claude-haiku-4-5

# Vercel OIDC token (optional, fallback only)
# Normally injected automatically. Populate it with `vc env pull` only if you
# are running `next dev` directly instead of `pnpm dev:vercel`.
# VERCEL_OIDC_TOKEN=

# --- Planned, not yet used ---
# The RAG phase in progress-chat-bot.md will add a Postgres connection for
# embedding storage. Nothing reads this today.
# POSTGRES_URL=postgres://user:password@host:port/database?sslmode=require
